{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13114030","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13114030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1311403001:0":{"text":"난 대체 얼음 위에 아름답고 로맨틱한 하트를 만든 거야, 안 만든 거야...?","source_cn":"我到底有没有在冰上滑出一个漂亮的、浪漫的心型啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB36FECDD7786497C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311403002:0":{"text":"이상하네, 왠지 이곳에서 아주 오랫동안 서 있었던 것 같은데... 휴, 발이 다 저리네. 너무 긴장한 탓인가?","source_cn":"好奇怪，总觉得我在这里站了好久。呼，脚都站麻了。我是太...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAB156FF3E48CBD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311403003:0":{"text":"긴장할 것 없어요. 하트를 그리는 건 그만두고 그냥 바로 프러포즈하시는 건 어때요?!","source_cn":"不要紧张，别滑什么心型了，直接去求婚吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C2990E5044F78DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311403004:0":{"text":"쉿! 조용히 해요! 카야가 듣겠어요... 나의 카야, 에스페리아에서 가장 아름다운 여인...","source_cn":"嘘，小声点！别让卡娅听见……我的卡娅，全伊索米亚最美的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD0D82DDB16A7A45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311403005:0":{"text":"어라, 이 말을 했던 것 같은 느낌이 드는데...","source_cn":"呃，我总觉得我好像跟你说过这句话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF437664A62FAEAA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱赫":{"text":"레프","source":"莱赫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}}